{%- doc -%}
  GENERATED FILE — do not edit by hand.
  Source: scripts/gen-product-flags.mjs, from data/product-audit.json (Phase 0).

  Outputs the manufacturing brand for an in-house part, or nothing at all.
  Liquid `render` is scope-isolated, so this returns a value to be captured
  rather than assigning variables the caller can read.

  Fallback only. snippets/syp-product-flags.liquid reads the
  `custom.made_in_house` metafield first and consults this when it is absent.

  In-house: 110   Resold: 36   Unclassified: 52

  The unclassified products are deliberately absent, so they resolve as resold
  until Spencer marks them in data/unknowns-review.csv. Claiming manufacture on
  a part nobody has confirmed is the mistake this file exists to prevent.

  @param {object} product - The product to test
{%- enddoc -%}

